{"title":"Sheep","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 2 Wildlife that attacks with stab (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"muted\">None known</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"muted\">None known</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No drops recorded for this monster yet.</div></div>\n      \n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><figure class=\"wp-inset\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"wp-inset-map\" style=\"transform:translate(-15.4px,27.8px)\"><img src=\"wtiles/3/-1/-1.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:-256px;top:-256px\"><img src=\"wtiles/3/-1/0.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:-256px;top:0px\"><img src=\"wtiles/3/0/-1.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:0px;top:-256px\"><img src=\"wtiles/3/0/0.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:0px;top:0px\"><i style=\"left:15.8px;top:-27.5px\"></i><i style=\"left:102.4px;top:6.2px\"></i><i style=\"left:108.3px;top:2.9px\"></i><i style=\"left:105.2px;top:8.3px\"></i></div><figcaption>Binxonia</figcaption></figure><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Binxonia\">Binxonia</a> <span class=\"muted\">· 5 spots</span></li><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Plymouth%20Wharf\">Plymouth Wharf</a> <span class=\"muted\">· 5 spots</span></li></ul><button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"sheep\">Show on map</button>\n      \n      <h2>Related</h2><p>Other Wildlife: <a href=\"#/monster/seagull\">Seagull</a> <span class=\"muted\">(1)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/rabbit\">Rabbit</a> <span class=\"muted\">(1)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/chicken\">Chicken</a> <span class=\"muted\">(1)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/frog\">Frog</a> <span class=\"muted\">(1)</span> · <a hre